The '''Ruins of Zeth''' is an ancient [[Corthan|Corthanian]] ruin<ref>{{questlong|Neutral|37|In Your Own Defense}}</ref> located in the northeastern mountains of the [[Badlands]], near [[Uldaman]]. Once the high temple<ref name=":0">[https://discord.com/channels/466622455805378571/528228771594240030/1086448472720412815 Gheor from the Turtle WoW Community Discord] (dead link) - "Zeth would translate as High Temple, and the Zeths are the High Priests of said temple."</ref> of a bygone civilization, it is now the haunt of the spirits of [[Ancient Warrior]]s. The [[Forgotten Keeper]] also resides in the ruins.

